# A first opponent: eager, swings at everything, misplays often.
name: Ryo
title: the Rookie
aggression: 0.8
caution: 0.15
patience: 0.1
spending: 0.9
skill: 0.3
decks: classic, warriors
intro: My first real duel! I've been practicing all week!
rematch: Round two! New deck, same me!
win: I did it! Wait till everyone hears about this!
lose: Aw man... okay, I'm adding more traps.
partner: We're a team?! Okay. I'm writing this down. Team duel number one!
look: Eager teen in a school uniform with untied shoelaces, a brand-new deck box, and a notebook full of combos.
ladder: 1   # campaign order (1 = first opponent)
signature: Luster Dragon   # the first-win gift and the bond 5 gift (CardUnlocks)
# Said during a duel: a big summon, hitting hard, taking a hit, falling to 1000 LP or less.
summon: Whoa, I actually pulled it off!
strike: Did you see that?! Did you SEE that?!
hit: Ow, ow, ow... okay, focus!
danger: Don't panic, don't panic, don't panic...
